FYI, we noticed the following commit (built with gcc-7):

commit: c470bdc1aaf36669e04ba65faf1092b2d1c6cabe ("mac80211: don't WARN on bad WMM parameters from buggy APs")
https://git.kernel.org/cgit/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git master

in testcase: hwsim
with following parameters:

	group: hwsim-01



on test machine: 8 threads Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-2600K CPU @ 3.40GHz with 8G memory

caused below changes (please refer to attached dmesg/kmsg for entire log/backtrace):


2018-04-20 03:46:16 	./run-tests.py ap_qosmap_default_acm 
DEV: wlan0: 02:00:00:00:00:00
DEV: wlan1: 02:00:00:00:01:00
